# 4. Full Message Flow

When message is sent:

```text
User sends message
        ↓
store message in DB
        ↓
cache message in Redis
        ↓
check receiver online
        ↓
if offline → store offline queue
        ↓
increment unread counter
        ↓
broadcast to room
```

---

# 5. Backend Example Flow

```ts
async function handleMessage(chatId, senderId, receiverId, message) {

  await saveMessageToDB(message);

  await cacheMessage(chatId, message);

  const isOnline = await redis.sismember("online_users", receiverId);

  if (!isOnline) {
    await queueOfflineMessage(receiverId, message);
  }

  await incrementUnread(receiverId, chatId);

  broadcastMessage(chatId, message);
}
```

---

# 6. Chat Open Flow

```text
user opens chat
      ↓
reset unread count
      ↓
fetch cached messages
      ↓
if empty → load from DB
```

Example:

```ts
await resetUnread(userId, chatId);

const messages = await getCachedMessages(chatId);
```

