Your Redis now supports **complete real-time messaging**:

```
session:{sessionId}
rate_limit:{userId}:{endpoint}:{minute}
login_attempts:{ip}:{hour}

ws_auth:{socketId}

user_socket:{userId}
socket_user:{socketId}

online_users

room:{chatId}

typing:{chatId}:{userId}

message_cache:{chatId}:recent
offline_messages:{userId}
unread_counts:{userId}:{chatId}
```
